The patches in patches/ change Rust (rust-lang/rust with cargo, backtrace and
llvm-project), the libc crate and the crates named in patches/crates; each patch
is under the licence of the project it changes (Rust, cargo, libc, backtrace:
MIT or Apache-2.0; llvm-project: Apache-2.0 with LLVM exception; the crates:
their own). The MIT licence above covers this repository's own files.
